    "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-rules-for-choosing-a-navigable creates traversables before the caller knows if a navigation will take place or not. How would we handle cases with `target=\"_blank\">` for `mailto` links, form action, links to files with a special MIME type like `.pdf`?\n\nIf we cannot guarantee that a navigation will clearly happen clients might need a fallback.",
