    "body": "But I think in all these cases we will still trigger `browsingContext.navigationStarted`, right? Yes, there might be no load events or/and `navigationFailed`/ `navigationAborted`. Which is the case with navigation to a normal page, it can still fail with, e.g., `404`. So I doubt that our goal here should be to say there will be a successful navigation, we probably want to only say that the navigation is planned (maybe that's a better name for the flag).",
