    "body": "Yeah, I think you're right that we need the reflow to happen to know if the iframe is in the viewport, so the `WebDriver BiDi navigable created` is happening too early for that. I think it wouldn't be such a good idea to move the timing of the event. I think we will need some other event for lazy iframes + a property on the \"browsingContext.contextCreated\" to indicate that it's a `lazy` navigable. I've updated the name of the property and removed the condition for the intersection and renamed the variable.",
